<section class="page-intro wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">We’re here for you</p><h1>Let’s talk<br><em>goodness.</em></h1></div><p>A question about your oil, an order, or stocking Oorvi? We’d love to hear from you.</p></section>
<div class="contact-layout wrap"><div class="contact-info"><p>Talk to a real person on our team. We’re based in Hyderabad and happy to help you find your way around our oils.</p><div class="contact-item"><h3>Give us a call</h3><a href="tel:+919642114488">+91 96421 14488</a></div><div class="contact-item"><h3>Write to us</h3><a href="mailto:care@oorvi.store">care@oorvi.store</a></div><div class="contact-item"><h3>Find us in Hyderabad</h3><p>House No. 7-90/4, Brundavan Colony, Kokapet<br>Hyderabad, Telangana 500075, India</p></div><div class="contact-item"><h3>Our hours</h3><p>Monday – Saturday · 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM IST</p></div></div><div class="contact-form"><h2>A little hello.</h2>{% form 'contact' %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="form-success" role="status">Your message has reached us. Our team will get back to you soon.</div>{% else %}{% if form.errors %}<div class="form-error" role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}<label for="contact-name">Your name</label><input id="contact-name" type="text" name="contact[name]" value="{{ form.name | default: customer.name | escape }}" autocomplete="name" required><label for="contact-email">Email address</label><input id="contact-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" value="{{ form.email | default: customer.email | escape }}" autocomplete="email" required><label for="contact-message">How can we help?</label><textarea id="contact-message" name="contact[body]" rows="5" required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><button class="button" type="submit">Send your message {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow' %}</button>{% endif %}{% endform %}</div></div>
